<title>TUNISIA: Tunisian Treasury raises 4 mln dinars at auction.</title>
<headline>Tunisian Treasury raises 4 mln dinars at auction.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunisian Treasury on Tuesday said it sold four million dinars of three-year notes at its weekly auction on October 8, repaying maturing paper totalling 25.1 million dinars.</p>
<p>The three-year notes payable in equal annual tranches were at a 9.1250-percent yield.</p>
<p>Banks bid for 43 million dinars of three-, four- and five-year notes at between 9.1250 and 9.5 percent.</p>
<p>($=0.97 dinar)</p>
<p>--Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
</text>
